# CMakeLists.txt cannot be hashed whole: a submission has to add one target per test
# file, and the acceptance corpus appends one of its own. The frozen region is therefore
# everything up to and including the "YOUR TESTS BELOW HERE" marker, which is what the
# file's own header promises is checked.
